# A pin on a stop, not on a route, showing a cancelled trip.
#
# `drilldown` pins the same stop scoped to route 44, so it never draws the 48
# that is cancelled there. Press `p` on a search result instead and you pin
# everything calling at the stop, because you never said where you were going.
#
# At 10:00 the next departure at pole 1869 is that cancelled 48. A pin draws one
# departure, so it is the one on screen, and a cancelled row gives an em dash
# where the countdown goes. The board has a test for that. The pin draws through
# a different arm of the same function and had none.
cache ../cache.db
date 2026-09-11
time 10:00
offset -04:00
size 100 14
